{"lines":[{"y":0.045066787105690342,"h":0.015700021632895078,"x":0.069910442140822551,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.12818134307861329,"c":1},{"x":0.068041225215888901,"y":0.094476744236180354,"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.79587631225585942,"c":1,"t":"product, for example. But it's absolutely crucial to recruit the right people as participants. As well"},{"c":1,"h":0.020856792340191777,"t":"as the criteria I've mentioned, they have to be comfortable talking about themselves and bejng.","x":0.069988600659229974,"y":0.10830612749391688,"w":0.7857573954264323},{"w":0.051546392440795952,"h":0.013081395479069058,"c":1,"x":0.86185566969227634,"t":"Q38","y":0.11191860454757219},{"c":1,"x":0.070103100057991891,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"watched as they go about their activities, Actually, most researchers say that people open up","y":0.1264534884208367,"w":0.76701029459635417},{"x":0.07010309396980427,"c":1,"w":0.62268040974934891,"t":"pretly easily, maybe because they're often in their own home or workplace.","h":0.01614797416324143,"y":0.14239577234481404},{"w":0.71340204874674473,"t":"So what makes this type of research special is that it's not just a matter of sending a","h":0.01614797416324143,"c":1,"y":0.16559013506615994,"x":0.068041243551117195},{"h":0.017323159079515316,"y":0.18182593504764455,"w":0.7196951802571615,"t":"questionnaire to the participants, instead the research is usually based on first-hand.","x":0.067999169261572567,"c":1},{"x":0.87422680483992643,"w":0.039175256093343047,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"y":0.18313953478013034,"t":"Q39"},{"t":"observation of what they are doing at the time. But that doesn't mean that the researcher","w":0.75463918050130208,"x":0.068041234387346022,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"y":0.19906048174859359},{"c":1,"x":0.067974767539409883,"t":"never talks to the participants. However, unlike in traditional research, in this case it's the","w":0.75271306355794265,"y":0.21315057692234418,"h":0.01894283462676738},{"x":0.0680412375552127,"y":0.23106283054462495,"w":0.76907216389973954,"t":"participant rather than the researchers who decides what direction the interview will follow.","h":0.013211978860833806,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"w":0.79175257364908846,"t":"This means that there's less likelihood of the researcher imposing his or her own ideas on the","x":0.070103094502585173,"y":0.24709302318876869},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.09278350194295247,"y":0.2630813952192439,"t":"participant.","c":1,"x":0.068041238229554699},{"t":"But after they've said goodbye to their participants and got back to their office, the","y":0.2877275397376623,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"x":0.068041228617424995,"w":0.69484537760416665},{"x":0.065910592616236746,"w":0.7547699483235677,"c":1,"t":"researchers' work isn't finished. Mostresearchers estimate that 70 to 80 per cent of their","h":0.017304461350947875,"y":0.3018328585937633},{"t":"Q40","h":0.013081395479068947,"x":0.87216494918195187,"y":0.30232558129175824,"w":0.039175256093343047,"c":1},{"x":0.068041235686491647,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"t":"time is spent not on the collecting of data but on its analvsis - looking at photos, listening to","w":0.777319590250651,"y":0.3197298885341946},{"x":0.068041234406158543,"t":"recordings and transcribing them, and so on. The researchers may end up with hundreds","y":0.33575581400319043,"w":0.75463918050130208,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"w":0.7587628682454427,"x":0.07010310185217776,"y":0.35173223733071002,"t":"of pages of notes. And to determine what's significant, they don't focus on the sensational","h":0.013211978860833806,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.36758661197634557,"w":0.78556701660156247,"h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.068041233855625285,"t":"things or the unusual things, instead they try to identify a patter of some sort in all this data,"},{"w":0.77938145955403648,"h":0.014534883616744931,"x":0.068041228883415961,"y":0.38372093028239385,"c":1,"t":"and to discern the meaning behind it. This can result in some compelling insights that can in"},{"c":1,"x":0.065850891809483017,"y":0.39835818347092333,"t":"turn feed back to the whole design process.","w":0.37346165974934897,"h":0.016442293289193444},{"t":"TEST 4","c":1,"x":0.40803302072446967,"y":0.45770004556719002,"w":0.10761744181315103,"h":0.017130551587394405},{"t":"SECTION 1","h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.5217263654366241,"c":1,"w":0.16288659413655598,"x":0.065979383242356845},{"c":1,"x":0.065979381008250654,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"y":0.55377906988162706,"t":"RO8:","w":0.037113402684529631},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"x":0.1402061914944151,"t":"Good morning. Stretton Festival box office. How can I help you?","c":1,"y":0.55079271858563184,"w":0.54432988484700529},{"t":"MELANIE:","x":0.061832919263562471,"y":0.5696914242373301,"w":0.068086738586425805,"h":0.010326453817639747,"c":1},{"t":"Oh, hello. My family and I are on holiday in the area, and we've seen some posters","y":0.56576140937367791,"w":0.7073807779947916,"x":0.13806273676492717,"h":0.018034630919370853,"c":1},{"w":0.69278350830078128,"c":1,"y":0.58426306494224867,"h":0.016147974163241319,"x":0.13814432822293687,"t":"about the festival this week. Could you tell me about some of the events, please?"},{"c":1,"t":"Of course.","y":0.59967541119157808,"h":0.014853800596101641,"w":0.091812407175699884,"x":0.13956320693284746},{"y":0.61626541373846522,"t":"First of all, are there still tickets available for the jazz band on Saturday?","w":0.61649485270182292,"h":0.014679976512037674,"x":0.13608247045356051,"c":1},{"t":"There are, but only £15. The £12 seats have all been sold.","w":0.5011610921223959,"c":1,"x":0.13806631018240803,"h":0.017346100462792058,"y":0.62978644411747575},{"t":"Ok. And the venue is the school, isn't it?","c":1,"x":0.13814432808841209,"y":0.64825581400120313,"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.35051546732584632},{"x":0.13814433215170746,"y":0.66265413997235478,"t":"Yes, that's right, the secondary school. Make sure you don't go to the primary school Q1","w":0.76082473754882818,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1},{"y":0.68023255818928319,"x":0.13814433818552194,"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.70515462239583326,"t":"by mistake! And there's an additional performer who isn't mentioned on the posters","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.38556701660156256,"t":"- Carolyn Hart is going to play with the band.","x":0.13814432665063484,"y":0.69612448597525134,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"t":"MELANIE: Oh, I think I've heard her on the radio. Doesn't she play the oboe, or flute or","w":0.71958760579427083,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"x":0.063917537210643333,"y":0.71220930225817858},{"y":0.7277400692498206,"h":0.015450094002383841,"c":1,"x":0.13801563130711783,"w":0.10128832499186199,"t":"something?"},{"t":"RO8:","y":0.74709302336999905,"w":0.03505154609680175,"c":1,"x":0.063917525817578522,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"x":0.13608247071351637,"y":0.74418604656151832,"t":"Yes. the flute. She usually plays with symphony orchestras, and apparently this is","w":0.70103093465169275},{"c":1,"t":"her first time with a jazz band.","y":0.76012918380027295,"w":0.25979380289713544,"x":0.13608247988992028,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"MELANIE: Well, I'd certainly like to hear her. Then the next thing I want to ask about is the duck","w":0.79587631225585931,"c":1,"x":0.061855658212693544,"y":0.7761627907476667},{"x":0.13608247885853017,"w":0.52164947509765625,"y":0.79213153283332116,"t":"races - I saw a poster beside a river. What are they, exactly?","c":1,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"w":0.039175256093343103,"t":"ROB:","y":0.81104651185844578,"x":0.061855670807179269,"c":1,"h":0.010174418083723991},{"t":"Well, you buy a yellow plastic duck - or as many as you like - they're a pound each.","y":0.80813953504613067,"w":0.71546391805013032,"h":0.015994346358813916,"c":1,"x":0.13814432932811654},{"c":1,"y":0.82412790702516647,"x":0.14020617530299831,"w":0.70309280395507812,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"And you write your name on each one. There'll be several races, depending on the"},{"c":1,"w":0.68041239420572919,"x":0.1381443182590085,"h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.83998825604237315,"t":"number of ducks taking part. And John Stevens, a champion swimmer who lives"},{"x":0.13608248077635759,"h":0.015988371754420583,"t":"locally, is going to start the races. All the ducks will be launched into the riyer at the.","y":0.8561046513273336,"w":0.71340204874674473,"c":1},{"w":0.67835052490234371,"x":0.13814432506721108,"c":1,"y":0.87199060507263049,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"back of the cinema, then they'll float along the river for 500 metres, as far as the"},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"railway bridge.","w":0.12989690144856766,"y":0.88808139538229547,"x":0.1360824769918145,"c":1},{"h":0.017671523483374862,"c":1,"y":0.90398357250164463,"w":0.29726084391276042,"t":"MELANIE: And are there any prizes?","x":0.061699669095838107},{"c":1,"t":"Example","w":0.078477484385172547,"x":0.86797775254011755,"y":0.63209578555404566,"h":0.014878196290711077},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"118","x":0.061855670819307831,"w":0.039175256093343103,"c":1,"y":0.95494186036152562},{"w":0.29360280354817708,"y":0.95282647550815269,"x":0.35215498527080541,"h":0.0241457972187753,"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org"}],"h":3406,"w":2400}